WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.732
The five princes arrived at the palace.

2
00:00:14.733 --> 00:00:18.220
One was tall and handsome.

3
00:00:18.221 --> 00:00:21.126
One was short and round.

4
00:00:21.127 --> 00:00:24.914
Two princes looked strong and fierce.

5
00:00:24.915 --> 00:00:32.906
One prince was quiet and shy.

6
00:00:32.907 --> 00:00:35.454
They were all polite.

7
00:00:35.455 --> 00:00:44.631
They bowed to Princess Mary.

8
00:00:44.632 --> 00:00:50.204
They talked about the weather.

9
00:00:50.205 --> 00:00:53.107
Tom peered into the Throne Room.

10
00:00:53.108 --> 00:00:56.797
"The princess looks bored," Cat whispered.

11
00:00:56.798 --> 00:01:00.384
"Those princes are being too polite."

12
00:01:00.385 --> 00:01:04.245
"I must do a good spell," Tom said.

13
00:01:04.246 --> 00:01:07.373
He pointed his wand at the princes.

14
00:01:07.374 --> 00:01:10.684
"Let the princess find," he said.

15
00:01:10.685 --> 00:01:12.937
"A prince who is kind!"

16
00:01:12.938 --> 00:01:17.617
Poof! The five princes turned into frogs!

17
00:01:17.618 --> 00:01:20.308
"Oops!" Tom said.

18
00:01:20.309 --> 00:01:23.082
The king stared at the frogs.

19
00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:26.689
"What happened?" he cried.

20
00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:28.675
He spotted Tom.

21
00:01:28.676 --> 00:01:36.484
"Wizard! Did you do this?"

22
00:01:36.485 --> 00:01:39.262
Dirk had an evil smile.

23
00:01:39.263 --> 00:01:44.102
"Throw that wizard in the Grim Dungeon!"

24
00:01:44.103 --> 00:01:47.813
Tom hung his head.

25
00:01:47.814 --> 00:01:51.899
"This is my worst mistake ever!" he thought.

26
00:01:51.900 --> 00:01:54.788
The king looked very worried.

27
00:01:54.789 --> 00:01:59.155
"Tom, turn these frogs back into princes at once!

28
00:01:59.156 --> 00:02:02.199
Their kingdoms will be angry with me.

29
00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.474
This could start a Royal War!"

30
00:02:05.475 --> 00:02:07.920
The queen gasped.

31
00:02:07.921 --> 00:02:10.476
"A Royal War?"

32
00:02:10.477 --> 00:02:15.412
Princess Mary was giggling softly.

33
00:02:15.413 --> 00:02:18.704
"I guess you must do it, Tom," she said.

34
00:02:18.705 --> 00:02:21.553
"Turn them back into princes."

35
00:02:21.554 --> 00:02:31.879
Tom bowed. "Of course," he said.

36
00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:37.900
"But I don't know how!" he thought.

